13. LIMITATIONS
13.1 Statistical Limitations
Issue	Current Status	Required for Confirmation
Horizons	4	≥ 10
Trajectories	2	≥ 5
Seeds	1	≥ 5
Total data points	~200 per horizon	≥ 1000 per horizon
Interpretation: These results should be interpreted as exploratory evidence, not confirmatory validation.

13.2 Coverage Estimation
Coverage estimators (k-NN, KDE, dispersion, union) are approximate and do not directly measure representational occupancy. They provide directional evidence, not ground truth coverage.

